  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.75 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon table salt",
    "0.5 cup milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour a 9-inch square cake pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a1BQ2b6pS1U7GRqzGFhq_5ElXEw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17481-simple-white-cake-ddmfs-3244-4x3-step-01-fa37ca03cdcc4b078afa2c1a0a961650.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17481/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter together in a mixing bowl with an electric mixer until lighter in color and fluffy, 3 to 4 minutes. Add eggs, one at a time, beating briefly after each addition, 30 seconds total. Mix in vanilla, about 15 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sc74515t2qoHeGX2_2nuAHcKQu0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17481-simpl-white-cake-mfs-003-8f86146a582c4e81871f813c1dca9709.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17481/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, baking powder, and salt in a separate bowl. With mixer on low speed, add flour mixture to butter mixture in 3 batches, alternating with milk, beginning and ending with flour. Mix just until combined stopping to scrape down sides if needed, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k7K24xaCYrl6GqS3UFefZX6A8nQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17481-simpl-white-cake-mfs-005-1a111e2a4fdd4c4595a0a9774efe340c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17481/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread cake batter into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fPYWDppNqhH8e8T0c8_zs8Iu1Eg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17481-simpl-white-cake-mfs-007-1082b3cb66d146b2b1ccaab4020468f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17481/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kMDyTC_pVg5JjxTn-vo3Dq6XIhI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17481-simpl-white-cake-mfs-006-d914106a241548abb664657e8b27fa47.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17481/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove cake from the oven and let cool in pan on a wire rack for 10 minutes. Invert cake onto wire rack; remove pan and let cake cool completely before frosting. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rceSb4HUcHI64nQj_8o6jnvAN-0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17481-simple-white-cake-DDMFS-4x3-89bf9ff32d0c40179a3d752d4d25f22a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17481/step_06.webp"
    }
